WHAT THIS COVERS

This repository: the appfactory marketplace, its plugins, the vendored runtime
(preflight checks and their fixtures, workflow templates, scaffold and helper
scripts), and its documentation.

WHAT IT DOES NOT COVER

Projects generated BY this pipeline are the work of whoever generates them. The
scaffold emits an application skeleton; nothing in this licence claims the app you
build with it, and no attribution is required in a generated app.

Third-party components retain their own licences. This repository vendors no
third-party source; it downloads toolchains (Android SDK, Gradle, JDK) and Android
dependencies at build time, each under its own terms.
